[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Remove one front wheel, proceed as in example</p><p><a href=\"#/2584772\">Op. 4450B06 LEFT REAR WHEEL - R.R.</a>.</p><p>1. Undo the fixing pins.</p><p>2. Remove the rear brake drum (2a); if the part is difficult to remove, use tool (2b) after removing the hub cap.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.847.015.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002378.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the drum.</p><p>Tighten the fixing pins.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR BRAKE DRUM</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Refit the front wheel, proceed as in example</p><p><a href=\"#/2584772\">Op. 4450B06 LEFT REAR WHEEL - R.R.</a>.</p>"]]